      ":question/problem": "![](images/4f/4f5da8e3385bb045259803491f2631d6fc858ec971eb20e27a59b7fc0e95bf8f.png)\n\nWater is evaporating from the reservoir. The amount of water in the reservoir, in liters, after $t$ days is given by the function $N(t)$. The graph of $N(t)$ is shown above.\n\nApproximate the rate of evaporation when $t = 2$ using a central difference approximation with step size $h = 1.5$.\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
